1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:04,660
Two Entry Limit orders are waiting on the Pending tab.

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:07,960
Select an order and press Enter to change its rate or amount.

3
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:12,140
Escape closes the window without changing anything.

4
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,390
To add a note to an order, right-click it and choose Comment.

5
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:17,970
Type up to 50 characters, then click Ok.

6
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:23,330
The order is updated with your note.

7
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:27,700
Choose Comment again to read or change it.

8
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:31,880
Ctrl+A selects every order.

9
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:36,200
The menu now reads Remove 2 Orders.

10
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:43,500
You are asked to confirm before anything is cancelled.

11
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,500
Both orders are cancelled.

